ould indicate potential credential harvesting.\n\n**Ignored (known false positives):**\n- claude-mem plugin: 7 issues in bun-runner.js, context-generator.cjs, mcp-server.cjs, smart-install.js, worker-cli.js\n- writing-skills skill: 1 issue in render-graphs.js\n\n**Warnings (2):**\n- Reverse proxy headers not trusted (if exposing Control UI)\n- Extension plugin tools may be reachable under permissive tool policy\n\n**Recommendation:** Review tavily-search skill source code before use. This appears to be a legitimate search skill that uses environment variables for API keys, but should be verified for trustworthiness.\n\n---\n\n**Action Required:** Alert Sam about the tavily-search skill critical issues immediately."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":713,"output":937,"cacheRead":9333,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10983,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771783226368}}
